Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.60,Safe,,0,0,0,,At 11:47 PM, the design is still yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:11.30,Safe,,0,0,0,,The math has taken over the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:18.90,Safe,,0,0,0,,One size is in the sketch. The rest are\Nin a grid of cells, formulas, and decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:24.50,Safe,,0,0,0,,That is not a failure of creativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:31.60,Safe,,0,0,0,,It is a workflow asking you to become\Nits spreadsheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:40.70,Safe,,0,0,0,,Stitch & Scale gives the decisions a surface\Nyou can question: gauge, tolerance, yarn bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:46.00,Safe,,0,0,0,,And when the sheet says blocked, it does not\Npretend the work is ready for a quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:52.60,Safe,,0,0,0,,I do not know how to knit. My late mother did.\NI wrote the math so you do not fight Excel at 11 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:55.00,Safe,,0,0,0,,Try the demo. Check the work.\NTell me where the math fails.
